@simthis/pglite-socket is a modified distribution of PGlite Socket by
Electric DB Limited:

https://github.com/electric-sql/pglite

This distribution uses its own package identity and depends on the
corresponding @simthis/pglite package. Exact upstream and fork source
revisions for each release are recorded in the signed fork-lineage
attestation associated with the package tarball:

https://github.com/simthis/pglite

